<title>PORTUGAL: Lusomundo, Warner in Spanish cinema deal.</title>
<headline>Lusomundo, Warner in Spanish cinema deal.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese entertainment group Lusomundo and U.S. group Time Warner Inc's Warner Brothers signed a contract with Spanish company Sogecable to open a chain of cinemas in Spain, Lusomundo said.</p>
<p>The 21.6-billion-escudo deal aims to provide 200 screens in Spanish shopping centres in the next four years, a statement said.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
